Name Belgium Note - Cave Afzetters #1


Interactability_Text_Line_0 Supply run to Ridders Van Licht HQ:
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 A couple guys will pose as refugees and gain access of the HQ from the inside.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_4 A few more guys will distract the guards at the gate, while the men inside will hijack the helicopter. 
Interactability_Text_Line_5 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_6 Once the situation is under control we will flee back to the cave. Assemble our men and ultimately flee Belgium.
